{"overview":"روباتِک یک اقتباس ۸۵ قسمتی از سه سریال انیمهٔ متفاوت است که بین سال‌های ۱۹۸۲ تا ۱۹۸۴ در ژاپن ساخته شد؛ این اقتباس در سال ۱۹۸۵ پخش شد. در داستان ترکیبی و ویرایش‌شده، «روباتِک‌تِکنولوژی» به پیشرفت‌های علمی اشاره دارد که در یک سفینهٔ بیگانگان که در جزیره‌ای در جنوب اقیانوس آرام سقوط کرده، کشف شده‌اند. با این فناوری، زمین ربات‌های عظیم‌جثه یا «مِچا» ساخت تا در برابر سه حملهٔ متوالی بیگانگان بجنگد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Robotech is an 85-episode adaptation of three different anime television series made between 1982-1984 in Japan; the adaptation was aired in 1985. Within the combined and edited story, Robotechnology refers to the scientific advances discovered in an alien starship that crashed on a South Pacific island. With this technology, Earth developed giant robotic machines or mecha to fight three successive extraterrestrial invasions.","tagline_en":"","runtime":25,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":7,"y":null,"poster":"/c4Cu7hlLppBAvacjnA5Tiwk5D4y.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":36,"y":1985,"poster":"/aQ7riR8u9gnFgtuSW4ES0kf2Q2p.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":24,"y":1985,"poster":"/vzx1cVwJgs45Z3W4kb7NpvMo2vC.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":25,"y":1985,"poster":"/9gR2pxVCWty6SRNMj2nBoAZouu6.jpg"}],"episodes":85,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US","JP"],"cast":[{"name":"Cam Clarke","role":"Lance Belmont (voice)","photo":"/hScRMNVHAFge06mOfFEauKcthtO.jpg"},{"name":"Gregory Snegoff","role":"Scott Bernard (voice)","photo":"/kDooPIo8VB3R79zNB1GVRvmStfH.jpg"},{"name":"Melanie MacQueen","role":"Ariel (voice)","photo":"/vIKKWiT5PrkZvFQkchN1Luz7S3S.jpg"},{"name":"Susie London","role":"Rook Bartley (voice)","photo":""}],"trailer":"","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/2192-robotech/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/uFL3c4Cq8M6WoLymlC5Y8bmGytV.png"},{"n":"Crunchyroll Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/qHLLmKo7udRgiSnIASVTwP2IxfJ.png"},{"n":"Amazon Video","kind":"rent